      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Wearing imposters sounds like fun, might not work all that well, but could be fun. \n\nFor the server side avatar conversion, I think that stripping extra polygons would be the hardest to do there. Vrchat is working on a thing for that to be done in the editor",
